    "text": "gridironfootballusa.com\nwebsite\nCitronelle\nDITR: OL Aiden Forrester, Citronelle High School (Citronelle, AL)\nBy Daria Perkins,\n13 hours agoMeet OL Aiden Forrester out of Citronelle High School. Aiden stands at 6’5 and 280 pounds. He has the size and strength to help control the line of scrimmage and is a key piece on his team’s offense. Described as a hard worker on and off the field, Aiden spends his evening training and his days in the classroom. He is already showing the student athlete work balance. He has dreams of playing at the next level and graduates in 2027. I got the chance to speak with him, here’s what he said.",
